  "reading": "Leave-one-project-out AUC 0.784 is at or above the 0.72 threshold set in advance, against a seed-group reference of 0.777. Holding out whole applications costs little, which is the delta-cancellation argument confirmed: the model reads the structural change, not the application's house style. Repository concentration is then a SCOPE LIMIT to state plainly -- eight applications, effective count 6.16 -- not a confound that invalidates the seed-group result. Corpus effort is better spent on the directive confound than on project diversity.",
